WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/analytics/components/analytics/OverviewTab.tsx — the "Overview" analytics tab. Composition:
    1. GlassPanel "Distance by Vehicle"      → Recharts BarChart over vehicle_comparison[].distance
                                               (SI km; web converts via convertDistanceFromSI(v.distance*1000, unit)).
    2. <OverviewVehicleComparison data/>     → SEPARATE surface P-0060 (its own prompt) — composed by the parent
                                               analytics page; intentionally OUT OF SCOPE here (prompt "Out of Scope").
    3. GlassPanel "Day of Week Pattern"      → Recharts ComposedChart: Bar(drives, left) + Line(avg_distance, right)
                                               over drive_analytics.day_of_week[] (raw, NOT unit-converted in web).
    4. GlassPanel "Monthly Cost Comparison"  → ComposedChart: Bar(cost) + Bar(gas_cost) grouped (left) + Line(savings,
                                               right) over charging_analytics.monthly_trend[] (raw currency).
    5. GlassPanel "Quick Links"              → 5 <Link> cards: /statistics /period-compare /weekly-digest /mileage
                                               /timeline (lucide icon + label + ArrowRight).
  Each chart panel renders its own <EmptyState> when its array is empty. Data sources: useTranslation, useUnits.

