PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  FadeIn                   → TSFadeIn (Components/Motion)
  GlassPanel + SectionTitle→ OverviewPanel (Color.TS.surface card + border + Font.TS.body semibold title)
  Recharts BarChart        → Swift Charts BarMark, categorical x = vehicle name, palette index 0
  Recharts ComposedChart   → Swift Charts BarMark + LineMark in one plot; Recharts left/right YAxis reproduced by
                             OverviewAxisScale (overlay the secondary series onto the primary domain; trailing axis
                             recovers original units) — day: drives[2]/avg_distance[3]; month: cost[0]/gas_cost[5]/
                             savings[1] (same CHART_COLORS indices as web, via TSChartPalette).
  Recharts <Legend/>       → custom OverviewChartLegend (color dot + localized series name)
  EmptyState               → OverviewEmptyRow (centered muted "No …" inside the panel — never hides the panel)
  Link cards               → OverviewQuickLinkCard Buttons routing through OverviewModel.openQuickLink → nav seam;
                             lucide→SF Symbol (BarChart3→chart.bar.fill, Activity→waveform.path.ecg, Calendar→calendar,
                             MapPin→mappin.and.ellipse, Clock→clock).
  units                    : web convertDistanceFromSI reproduced as a PURE adapter function (km + mi); only the
                             Distance-by-Vehicle chart is converted (web parity — day/month plotted raw).
  i18n                     : every string via OverviewStrings (P1/S10); zero English literals in code paths.
  a11y                     : each chart is one VoiceOver element with a min/max/latest summary; quick-link Buttons are
                             .isLink with localized labels; panel titles are headers; reduce-motion via TSFadeIn/skeleton.
  telemetry                : view.opened surface="OverviewTab" via the P1/S11 seam (OSLog default sink), emitted once.

STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces)
  loading  → OverviewLoadingChrome skeleton panels (initial fetch, no cached data).
  empty    → per-chart OverviewEmptyRow (No vehicle data / No day-of-week data / No monthly data) inside each panel.
  error    → OverviewErrorState (QueryError equivalent: icon + message + Retry → model.refresh()).
  stale    → freshness chip "Stale" + reconnecting banner + ONE guarded auto-refresh (tested once-per-episode).
  offline  → freshness chip "Offline" + offline banner over the last-loaded (cached) charts.
  content  → the four sections with live charts.

